+//
+// The menus, the status bar and the console keep their size on any frame:
+// they are drawn on a 2D screen of vid.conwidth by vid.conheight, the frame
+// divided by draw_scale, a whole number so their pixels stay square. It is
+// the frame's height in 480s, rounded, unless vid_scale sets it; and never so
